# Tasks Workflow

## Start every session

1. Read `tasks.md`
2. Claim highest-priority `pending` or resume `in_progress`
3. Set `Status: in_progress`, `Assignee`, `Updated: <date>`

## While working

- Follow `AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/`
- If blocked → `Status: blocked` + describe in Notes
- New scope discovered → add TASK-NNN (increment counter)

## When done

- `Status: done`, check acceptance criteria
- Notes: brief summary of what changed
- Update docs if contracts changed

## Format

```markdown
## [TASK-NNN] Title
- **Status:** pending | in_progress | blocked | done | cancelled
- **Assignee:** agent-name / unassigned
- **Priority:** P0 | P1 | P2
- **Scope:** paths affected
- **Acceptance criteria:** checkboxes
- **Notes:** progress log
- **Updated:** YYYY-MM-DD
```

## Do not

- Start coding without checking tasks.md
- Leave tasks in_progress without Notes when switching context
- Forget to increment "Next ID" when adding tasks
